# pan-release-still (h2-input): a 200 px drag, held still 300 ms, released.
# No glide starts (the flick window only sees the standstill); the release's
# frame flushes the URL at once. Behaviour: one post-release frame, then
# rest; url center=-4.0000,0.0000, no scale key.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 728 490
down
move 928 490 over 128
wait 300
up
wait 1000
shot pan-release-still
